    "answer": {
      "short": "$[-2,4]$.",
      "worked": "Let $y=f(x)$.\n$$\\begin{align*}y-1&=\\frac{3x+2}{4}-1\\\\y-1&=\\frac{3x-2}{4}\\end{align*}$$\nThe domain restriction becomes\n$$\\begin{align*}|y-1|&\\le 3\\\\-3&\\le y-1\\le 3\\\\-2&\\le y\\le 4\\end{align*}$$\nThe range is $[-2,4]$.",
